"Many citizens will not have noticed it yet, the red dots for Sunday emptying are still at various mailboxes of the core city and the districts, but if you read the fine print on the yellow containers of Post AG, you quickly find out that the emptying on Sundays and holidays no longer takes place," the FDP announces.
